        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**This is the scar, mapped from Landsat 9: 196 hectares\nof slope that is no longer there.**\n\nNDRRMA put the detached mass at about **1 km²** of rock-glacier material.\n\n**On the map:** the brown outline is the source area\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The ground it came off"
