          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Past Bidur the bed falls 2.6 m per km and the river finally has room.**\n\nThe channel still shows, but the valley takes it. The same box holds **154**\nmarked destroyed, against 490 and 703 upstream.\n\n**703, then 490, then 154**, in three identical boxes down one river.\n\n**On the map:** the yellow reach\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The open valley"
        }
      }
    },
