          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**below Bidur, the same six kilometres square, before the flood and after it.**\n\n![below Bidur, before and after](attachment:fig-before-after-yellow.png)\n\nHere the change is modest: a wider pale channel, more sand. This is the same\nflood that erased the gorge, arriving somewhere with room to take it.\n\nPale grey is ground no satellite saw clearly in the days after. Every pass was\n70 to 90 per cent cloud, so both sides are built from the clear pixels of\nseveral passes.\n",
