        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The wave took most of a working day to cross the country, and it was timed the\nwhole way.**\n\nGalchhi at **10:28**. Malekhu **11:50**. Mugling **13:00**. Devghat **15:20**,\nwhere it peaked at about **5,850 m³/s** an hour later.\n\n**57.4 million m³** of water in all, about\n20.0 million of it above what the river\nwas already carrying.\n\n**On the map:** the flood path and the observed water line\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "Where it got to, and when"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000011": {
      "name": "It destroyed the most upstream and killed the most downstream",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 9.0,
        "extent": [
          9245186.985396827,
          3099260.4625948602,
          9590070.85702317,
          3353337.144617459
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.4
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
