            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The debris dammed the channel in places, and those dams are still forming and\nstill failing.**\n\nUNOSAT detected two barrier lakes on imagery of 28 August,\n**20 ha** and\n**12 ha**. NDRRMA report that some of the\nimpoundments have since drained, and that more can form while the banks are\nunstable and the rain continues.\n\nAbove a valley that has lost its road and most of its bridges.\n\n**On the map:** the teal shapes are the two lakes · brown is the source area\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "What is still up there"
        }
      }
    },
