            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {
            "fig-reflight.png": {
              "image/png": ""
            }
          },
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Every count of this flood is provisional, and they do not agree with each\nother.**\n\nFour organisations counted destroyed buildings and got\n**2,813**, **5,048**, **1,641** and **677** —\nover different ground, by different methods, with different definitions of\ndestroyed. None of them is the number.\n\n![The same ground graded twice, two days apart](attachment:fig-reflight.png)\n\nCopernicus graded one area on 29 August, then flew it again on 31 August.\nNothing on the ground changed in between. The second look found\n**653 more buildings\ndestroyed** than the first.\n\nAn early damage count is a floor, not a total.\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "Four counts of the same thing"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000015": {
      "name": "What is still not known",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.6,
        "extent": [
          9410838.06745388,
          3200764.3708899487,
          9524607.316681117,
          3284578.4188578855
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.4
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
